  "notes": "{小|ちい}さな is a pre-noun adjectival form.\n\nCOMPARISON:\n- {小|ちい}さな + noun (pre-noun form)\n- {小|ちい}さい + noun (i-adjective form)\n- Both mean the same, but {小|ちい}さな can only precede nouns.\n\nOPPOSITE:\n- {大|おお}きな (big - pre-noun form)\n- {大|おお}きい (big - i-adjective)\n\nNOTE: Only {小|ちい}さい can be used predicatively: この{犬|いぬ}は{小|ちい}さい。",
